{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50787","headline":"题宿州城西宋徵君林亭 · 张祜","name":"题宿州城西宋徵君林亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"数亩四郊地，纽带胜渐偏。\n磴崖欹入竹，筒水下浇田。\n黑壤沾河润，红葩寄树鲜。\n驿明昏岸火，樯插晓林烟。\n嫩笋撑檐曲，新荷帖沼圆。\n不妨成隐显，长日步通阡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50787.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50787","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}